OL,3,ABurnham 'really concerned' if Man City
OL,4,Aowners sell up after rule breaches
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn independent commission found the
OL,7,Fclub had breached the majority of the
OL,8,FPremier League financial rules they
OL,9,Fwere accused of breaking, a verdict
OL,10,Fthat City are expected to appeal.
OL,12,FThe club continue to deny any
OL,13,Fwrongdoing and have until 2 October to
OL,14,Fsubmit an appeal.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
